// The .exe's icon (Makefile: windres -I docs/icon). ID 1: Explorer and the taskbar use the first icon resource.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
// Its manifest: UTF-8 as the process code page (Windows 10 1903+), so the C library's file functions (fopen, stat,
// opendir) and the -A Windows calls take and give the UTF-8 paths the runtime uses everywhere - a game file or folder
// named with an accent ("Pokémon") is otherwise "Pok?mon" and not found.
1 24 "runtime/platform/windows.manifest"
